# #5840 S4, a5e2e2ef's R2: a claim relinquished in flight is discarded on completion.
MODULE: LiveDonorProgressRelinquishLateClaimReinstalls
TARGET: LiveDonorProgress
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a claim in flight at the counted close completes after the relinquish and re-installs the relinquished epoch, so every append self-fences (R2)
PERTURBS: LiveClaimDone
BOUNDS: WithStaleDonor = TRUE, WithPreArm = TRUE, MaxWindows = 1, WithRestart = FALSE

--- FIND
             [] relEpoch = 0 /\ lClaim > lEpoch -> /\ liveArmed' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the completion installs whatever the relinquish.
             [] ~stale -> /\ liveArmed' = TRUE
--- END
